# Stock upstream Electron (version pinned in package.json). The private
# nv-dmabuf S3 build (electron_mirror=tellyo-binaries) is no longer used:
# the GBM linear shim (native/gbm-linear-shim, LD_PRELOAD from bin/run.sh)
# provides the NVIDIA scanout-allocation fix at runtime instead, so a stock
# Electron/Chromium build works for shared-texture dmabuf capture.
